      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    trade_prices = [25.20, 25.22, 25.27]\n    bid_prices = [25.17, 25.19, 25.22]\n    ask_prices = [25.20, 25.22, 25.26]\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    effective_spreads = []\n    for trade_price, bid_price, ask_price in zip(\n        trade_prices, bid_prices, ask_prices\n    ):\n        midpoint = (bid_price + ask_price) / 2\n        effective_spread = 2 * abs(trade_price - midpoint)\n        effective_spreads.append(effective_spread)\n\n    answer = round(sum(effective_spreads) / len(effective_spreads), 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
